cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyGTide, please cite it as below."
title: "PyGTide"
abstract: "A Python module and wrapper for ETERNA PREDICT to compute gravitational tides on Earth. It wraps ETERNA PREDICT 3.4, updated with the KSM03 tidal catalogue, and is compiled into a Python extension using f2py."
authors:
